          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "xaysé', adoodá' naa tleéhh dír Samaria nee munguiiwós awa murslaaq a aleeslawaakáhe ngiwa tleehh dír Yerusalemu nee murslaaqatuuwose?» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Aako bar gadiyeérós sleémeero ngaa boo/eés gawaá daanduú tloomár Siyoniro nee Yerusalemuro, inós saga gawduú waawutmoó Ashuru nee daara/aangose gi sakwasleemuut, nee adoodá' tiwa kilós xirfayeemisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma waawutmo i kaahi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám malé alé baraá deeloodae penoó aa meet oo múk Israeli, mukdá' niiná naa /uy oo doó Yakobo, inósuudá' gaa muux ngu harahhifiaaka, ala aqo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Kudá' Hhoohhoó' oo Israeli, ngun harahhifiyá' ar looeema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panoó Yakobo kudá' aa meet i kii/ amór Munguú /uuruú koóm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma mukók oo Israeli tam ku yaariire adór hhasángw afaá tlawi, aqo har panoó niiná kilós nin kii/, hhaamisa kaa geerií oó', nee gan'amu aa tleehharuút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Aako MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo in adoorí kah, hhaamiisár taa geerií káh ga boo/ees baraá yaamu sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, Aako MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo i kaahi, «Xaysé', muk'eé' kuungá' awa Siyonír hootá', ma da'ayumitaara' qoomár burnu muxiyá' ar hhara nee ar qawaay, tam ugwa daanda tsi/isi ar adoodá' múk Misri aa tlehhiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma alaá deelór niinawe buhhta i faakiyá', nee buhhtaaeé' i warqayá' amór múk Ashuru ngiri qwaareés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo qawaywós gun gáwtí tleés, adoodá' múk Midiani ngura muúx dír tlaa/ár Orebu wa ale, hhartós gan looloqoos gawaá daanduú tlawi. Inós ga gáwtí tlees ar adoodá' aa tleéhh dír múk Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám male ale baraá deeloodae huwaawós gi hingees gawaá suumaroge, nee taaqwaniirós gawaá istoge gan giqáy.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
